proton-autogen (2.5.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Patch Battle.net
    - Stability - New Profil dx11BNet

  * Added user profile system (Pro mode)
    - JSON profiles stored in ~/.config/proton-autogen/profiles/
    - Allows per-game environment customization

  * Added --json-profile option
    - Generates default profile templates
    - Includes dx11, dx12, launcher, legacy, oldgame, ut99, ut3, desktop

  * Added --profile <name> option
    - Loads and applies a user profile at runtime
    - Overrides environment variables safely

  * Improved execution pipeline
    - Profile system integrated into environment build stage
    - Compatible with automatic exe detection and Proton/Wine fallback

  * Stability improvements
    - Better separation between detection and user overrides
    - Fixed conflicts between auto profiles and user profiles

